Text: Three models were explored to obtain the sentence vectors: averaging the vectors of the words in one sentence, paragraph vectors and speciﬁc word vectors. The ﬁrst model, averaging word vectors (AV GWV EC), is to average the vectors in word sequence w =< w1, x2, ...wn >. The main process in this model is to learn the word embedding matrix Ww: P W xi Vavgwvec(w) = 1 w (4) n where Ww is the word embedding for word xi, which is learned by the classical word2vec algorithm [17].

